# `| SELECT *` with no table before the pipe: no fix that removes it, and no panic.
mode: syntax
---- query
| SELECT *
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..11
  PIPELINE@0..10
    PIPE@0..1 "|"
    WHITESPACE@1..2 " "
    ERROR@2..10
      IDENT@2..8 "SELECT"
      WHITESPACE@8..9 " "
      STAR@9..10 "*"
  WHITESPACE@10..11 "\n"

error[DS0125]: a query starts with a table, not with `|`
  --> query:1:1
  |
1 | | SELECT *
  | ^ this pipe has nothing to read from
  |
  = help: start the query with a file path such as `'data.csv'`, or a table name

error[DS0105]: SQL keyword `SELECT` is not an operator
  --> query:1:3
  |
1 | | SELECT *
  |   ^^^^^^ this is SQL
  |
  = help: choose or compute columns with `project`: `project a, b`
